  <entry>
    <title>JS的事件调度</title>
    <link href="/2022/07/21/JS%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6/"/>
    <url>/2022/07/21/JS%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="JS的事件调度"><a href="#JS的事件调度" class="headerlink" title="JS的事件调度"></a>JS的事件调度</h1><h4 id="定时器"><a href="#定时器" class="headerlink" title="定时器"></a>定时器</h4><p>定时器的回掉函数是宏任务，定时器在扫描到代码后就开始计时，然后将其回掉函数放到宏任务队列，当主线程任务执行完后扫描微任务和宏任务再做执行，所以定时器的毫秒数不是精确执行的事件，要推迟一点。</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;111&quot;</span>)<br>&#125;, <span class="hljs-number">2000</span>)<br><span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;222&quot;</span>)<br>&#125;, <span class="hljs-number">1000</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; <span class="hljs-number">1000000</span>; i++) &#123;<br><br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-comment">// 222 111 且不是2S以后，是几乎一起出现</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="Promise的顺序"><a href="#Promise的顺序" class="headerlink" title="Promise的顺序"></a>Promise的顺序</h4><p>promise内的任务是同步任务，最先执行，但then内的是微任务，晚于同步任务，先于宏任务执行。</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;定时器&quot;</span>)<br>&#125;, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">reslove</span> =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;promise&quot;</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">reslove</span>()<br>&#125;).<span class="hljs-title function_">then</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;then&quot;</span>)<br>&#125;)<br><span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;同步任务&quot;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">//promise 同步任务 then 定时器</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="promise与定时器嵌套"><a href="#promise与定时器嵌套" class="headerlink" title="promise与定时器嵌套"></a>promise与定时器嵌套</h4><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;定时器&quot;</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;timeout timeout&quot;</span>)<br>  &#125;, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">reslove</span> =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;settimeout Promise&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-title function_">reslove</span>()<br>  &#125;).<span class="hljs-title function_">then</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;settimeout then&quot;</span>)<br>  &#125;)<br>&#125;, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Promise</span>(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">reslove</span> =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;promise&quot;</span>)<br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">reslove</span>()<br>&#125;).<span class="hljs-title function_">then</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;then&quot;</span>)<br>&#125;)<br><span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;同步任务&quot;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">//同步任务</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">//then</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">//定时器</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">//settimeout Promise</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">//settimeout then</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">//timeout timeout</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h4 id="DOM渲染任务"><a href="#DOM渲染任务" class="headerlink" title="DOM渲染任务"></a>DOM渲染任务</h4><p>DOM渲染最好放在JS脚本前面，因为JS会阻塞DOM渲染</p><h4 id="宏任务和微任务"><a href="#宏任务和微任务" class="headerlink" title="宏任务和微任务"></a>宏任务和微任务</h4><p>宏任务有：setTimeout，setInterval，DOM事件，AJAX请求<br>微任务：Promise，async、await</p><p>（微任务执行时机比宏任务早）（微任务&gt;DOM渲染&gt;宏任务）</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
